Title: Two women killed at Kentucky church as gunman opens fire after shooting officer
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Lexington Police Chief Lawrence Weathers', 'Text': "A state trooper pulled over Mr House's car on Terminal Drive after receiving a registration plate reader alert, Lexington Police Chief Lawrence Weathers told a news conference.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 156}}, {'Speaker': 'Lexington Police Chief Lawrence Weathers', 'Text': 'He said that incident had no connection to the airport.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 157, 'EndChar': 210}}, {'Speaker': 'Chief Weathers', 'Text': 'The suspect shot the trooper, inflicting non-life threatening injuries, according to Chief Weathers.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 87}}, {'Speaker': 'Chief Weathers', 'Text': '"The suspect fired his weapon at individuals on church property," Chief Weathers said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 77}}, {'Speaker': 'Chief Weathers', 'Text': '"The suspect was shot by responding law enforcement and was pronounced deceased at the scene," said Chief Weathers, adding that the gunman\'s identity would be released once next-of-kin had been notified.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 186}}, {'Speaker': 'county coroner official', 'Text': 'It\'s a very tight-knit group of people," he added.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 16, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 46}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Two people have been fatally shot at a church in Kentucky after a car chase that began with a gunman shooting and injuring a police officer, officials said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 127}}, {'Description': 'The suspect shot a state trooper during a traffic stop before car-jacking a vehicle and driving to Richmond Road Baptist Church in Lexington, where he opened fire at parishioners, before law enforcement shot him dead.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 222}}, {'Description': "Two women, aged 72 and 32, died in Sunday's incident at the place of worship, and two male parishioners were injured, said police.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 117}}, {'Description': 'Investigators believe the suspect had a connection to individuals at the church.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 71}}, {'Description': 'Local authorities have identified the suspect as 47-year-old Guy House.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 66}}, {'Description': 'The initial shooting occurred at 11:36 local time (15:36 GMT) on Sunday near the Blue Grass Airport, a regional hub in Fayette County.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 121}}, {'Description': "The gunman then carried out a car-jacking, during which the vehicle's occupant was not hurt, before driving towards the church about 16 miles (25km) away, with law enforcement in pursuit.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 170}}, {'Description': '"Preliminary information indicates that the suspect may have had a connection to the individuals at the church."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 81}}, {'Description': 'Four people - two males and two females - were shot on church grounds.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 59}}, {'Description': "An official from the county coroner's office named the two women as Beverly Gum, 72, and Christina Combs, 32. They were pronounced dead at the scene.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 13, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 142}}, {'Description': 'The two male victims were transported to a local hospital, with one sustaining critical injuries and the other in a stable condition.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 112}}, {'Description': 'The county coroner official said the church was small and most attendees were either related or close friends.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 94}}, {'Description': "The incident was being investigated by the Kentucky State Police and the department's Public Integrity Unit.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 103}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Police stand outside of the Richmond Road Baptist Church in Lexington, Kentucky after a deadly shooting'}]}
